 "name_en": "Make-to-Order Production – Discrete Manufacturing (7V9)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Make-to-Order Production – Discrete Manufacturing (7V9)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiob42d0395c88c4f5eae02c2f3b4800ec8\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob42d0395c88c4f5eae02c2f3b4800ec8__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The Make-to-Order process starts with a customer order and ends with the hand-over of order specific production plan to shop floor.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The process starts with a sales order creation that references the quote.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The production process is triggered by a material requirement planning (MRP) run for the finished product and BoM components.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The results of production run is monitored within Product View and Alert Monitor. Delays can be resolved within Product View, Capacity overloads are resolved within Advanced Scheduling Board.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Finally planned orders are transferred to shop floor by order conversion into production orders.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob42d0395c88c4f5eae02c2f3b4800ec8__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Create sales order</p></li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Plan production in a make-to-order scenario, optionally with a sales order bill of material</p></li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Monitor planning results in Product View and Alert Monitor</p></li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Reschedule orders in Product View and Advanced Scheduling Board</p></li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Order conversion of planned orders to production orders</p></li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob42d0395c88c4f5eae02c2f3b4800ec8__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\">\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Enable Make-To-Order production</p></li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Reduce inventory costs by initiating production after you receive a customer order</p></li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Execute production specific to customer requirements and specification</p></li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Enable efficient monitoring of production plan and incorporation of manual adjustments</p></li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob42d0395c88c4f5eae02c2f3b4800ec8__non_standard\">\n      <p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph emphasis\">Exclude from Default Activation</span></p>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item is excluded from the default activation.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob42d0395c88c4f5eae02c2f3b4800ec8__non_standard_reason\">\n      <p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph emphasis\">Reason for Excluding from Default Activation</span></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>按订单生产 – 离散制造 (7V9)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiob42d0395c88c4f5eae02c2f3b4800ec8\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob42d0395c88c4f5eae02c2f3b4800ec8__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">按订单生产流程从客户订单开始，以订单特定生产计划移交到车间结束。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">此流程从参考报价的销售订单创建开始。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">生产流程由成品和物料清单组件的物料需求计划 (MRP) 运行触发。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">生产运行的结果在产品视图和警报监控器中进行监控。延迟可以在产品视图中解决，产能过载在高级计划板中解决。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">最后，通过将订单转换为生产订单，将计划订单传输到车间。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob42d0395c88c4f5eae02c2f3b4800ec8__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">创建销售订单</p></li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">在按订单生产场景中计划生产，可以选择使用销售订单物料清单</p></li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">在产品视图和警报监控器中监控计划结果</p></li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">在产品视图和高级计划板中重新计划订单</p></li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">计划订单到生产订单的订单转换</p></li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob42d0395c88c4f5eae02c2f3b4800ec8__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\">\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">启用按订单生产</p></li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">通过在收到客户订单后启动生产，降低库存成本</p></li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">执行特定于客户要求和规范的生产</p></li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">支持高效监控生产计划，并整合手动调整</p></li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob42d0395c88c4f5eae02c2f3b4800ec8__non_standard\">\n      <p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph emphasis\">从默认激活中排除</span></p>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目从缺省激活中排除。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob42d0395c88c4f5eae02c2f3b4800ec8__non_standard_reason\">\n      <p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph emphasis\">从缺省激活中排除的原因</span></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
